# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Sephetho ngola: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ([''] tccompare: ['']), mola-o-mocha.
